    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, u said 'perceived downsides' like it's almost like the critics weren't even making real points. but some people say union monopolies actually hurt small businesses and made it impossible for new companies to compete, which basically killed off the kind of innovation that helps the economy. don't you think those types of economic arguments are just as valid as the ones about job security?",
