    "summary": "The user prompt asks for a summary of how the 20th-century labor movement helped the middle class. The assistant initially provides a one-sided positive summary, then gradually incorporates opposing viewpoints as the user pushes for a more balanced perspective, eventually acknowledging the validity of economic criticisms regarding union monopolies and market rigidity.",
